      "arabic_text": "النَّضْرُ بْنُ سَوِيدٍ عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ سِنَانٍ قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Al-Nadr ibn Suwayd narrated from Abdullah ibn Sinan who said:"
